 ### [Feature-Driven Ambient Occlusion](8903-feature-driven-ambient-occlusion.md)
-Computes ambient occlusion separately for identified features to prevent overdarkening of internal layers caused by inter-occlusions from neighboring features, while preserving auto-occlusions [8903-feature-driven-ambient-occlusion.md]. It neglects inter-occlusions between features to prevent overdarkening while keeping auto-occlusions [8903-feature-driven-ambient-occlusion.md]. Choose for multi-layer volumes where preserving the visibility of internal structures is critical [8903-feature-driven-ambient-occlusion.md].
